Everyone’s talking about whether AI should be open or closed.

But that’s not the real question.

The real question is:
who actually controls what an AI knows about you?

Because the moment it starts remembering your thoughts, your patterns, your life —
it’s no longer just a tool.

It becomes a system that quietly shapes you over time.

And if you don’t control that system…
someone else does.

